        "id": 1558197
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-07-04T11:45:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My goal is to replace the old algorithm with the new one. For PoC I\u0027m only interested in Zephyr-based DUTs.\nWe can safely assume that these new values are not going to be used by legacy algorithm as body_detection.c shall not be compiled on Zephyr. Anyway, these configs are only a fallback. Normally the variance_threshold and confidence_delta are stored in *.dtsi file.\n\nAll of these configs are a copy-paste from non-Zephyr EC. It seems the CQ requires Kconfigs to have exactly the same set of options for both OSes so that\u0027s probably why no one removed these configs so far.",
      "parentUuid": "160a82ec_7b09e748",
      "revId": "f4117c9a1f37c174610e10667a2cbd877d40a900",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
