      "message": "I\u0027m not sure how these config files work too well, but can this depend on `CONFIG_BODY_DETECTION` rather than just being enabled?\n\nIf not, please add a comment indicating why the FPU is required for Winterhold, so we don\u0027t blindly copy it to future variants unless it\u0027s required.",
